        "metadata": {
          "category": "stories",
          "maxAge": 3,
          "media": {
            "duration": 921,
            "fileSize": 14935530
          },
          "description": "This Alison Lester audio collection features five stories, including the beloved Kissed by the Moon, narrated by Kate Cole.  Kissed by the Moon: Part poem, part lullaby, this gentle story celebrates a baby's wonder at our beautiful world. My Dog Bigsy: Join in the fun in this energetic story about a little dog who causes a big commotion. Our Island: Alison Lester and Elizabeth Honey collaborate with the children of Mornington Island to lyrically explore the wonders of their island home. I’m Green and I’m Grumpy: Discover who is hiding in the dress-up cupboard in this whimsical and funny story. Who’s That Knocking: Guess who is knocking on the front door in another warm and funny story that will delight young children. Listen to these timeless stories and create treasured memories together.",
          "abridged": false,
          "author": "Alison Lester",
